{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "latam", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1541030400, "end_date": 1543622399, "month_true_total": 5, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:30:46 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "47200242", "author": {"steamid": "76561198262994606", "personaname": "overclock11", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/overclock11/", "num_games_owned": 102, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 1743, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 394, "last_played": 1720562294, "avatar": "90281bcb08a9d28ef4c343c5f6b8b75f093e4a9b"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Es un juego en mi opinión fuera de lo común, entretiene, hasta el momento me ha parecido divertido, la recomendación es que busquen siempre alguna partida y se unan es mejor jugarlo entre varios", "timestamp_created": 1543543597, "timestamp_updated": 1543543597, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47097055", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020733739", "personaname": "Nyhbi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nyhbi/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 3884, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1260, "last_played": 1644966007, "avatar": "52a5c34fbde8642e5362b5b28b1cfeb7c73c5d93"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Este juego tiene mucho potencial. Incluso estando en early access ya tiene suficiente contenido para entretener a una party. Es un Left 4 Dead con empleados enanos explotados por una empresa minera, con varias clases, todas útiles en lo que se especilizan y con un ritmo más tranquilo.", "timestamp_created": 1543286169, "timestamp_updated": 1543286169, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "46481367", "author": {"steamid": "76561198076236628", "personaname": "ɹoɹɹǝ⊥", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GengarEX/", "num_games_owned": 467, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 5374, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5374, "last_played": 1762025446, "avatar": "1df3535a6f4c9bcf76d310fff46700d18b98412c"}, "language": "latam", "review": "solo dire: \"ROCK AND STONE\"", "timestamp_created": 1542930847, "timestamp_updated": 1762181354, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "46066875", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091141875", "personaname": "Thymaius", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198091141875/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 6952, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 478, "last_played": 1712986829, "avatar": "5d2541364dbdc0bc1b2d8311b2d2c02780b5252b"}, "language": "latam", "review": "El juego es entretenido, especialmente si lo jugas con amigos, la ambientacion y la idea de las misiones son bastante interesantes. Lo unico malo que veo en el juego es la poca gente que tiene y que luego de unas horas se empieza a volver un poco repetitivo.\nEdit 24/04/19: Luego de unos meses decidi volver a jugarlo, lo repetitivo se volvio mucho mejor. Agregaron una cantidad enorme de nuevo contenido y mucho mas por venir.", "timestamp_created": 1542840282, "timestamp_updated": 1556133222, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494897216558456421", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "45687758", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084349460", "personaname": "Deniro*90", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198084349460/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 71127, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11357, "last_played": 1786832138, "avatar": "c3e27d2b673bef5fc17661345f30f81feed27db5"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Solo quiero decir que si queres divertirte en un juego con amigos, o desconocidos, este es tu juego.  A mi gusto, es un juegazo. He pasado horas haciendo partidas con compañeros. No es necesario hablar el mismo idioma si es uno de tus problemas. El juego se presta para que todxs se entiendan y todos los meses lo actualizan. Ojala sigan asi, le pongo un 10.", "timestamp_created": 1541611415, "timestamp_updated": 1548926999, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}